{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415672","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415672","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041567201:1":{"text":"지금도 숲은 세 현자가 다스리고 있습니까?","source_cn":"如今的丛林，仍然是三贤者管理吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E058EC395C7ABFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567202:1":{"text":"그렇단다. 한 자리는 아직 공석이지만.","source_cn":"是啊，虽说有一位贤者的职位暂时空缺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7963B3EE92EDE6EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567203:1":{"text":"하지만 젊은 세대들이 슬슬 나서기 시작했지. 우리 같은 늙은이들은 이제 물러날 때가 온 것 같구나.","source_cn":"不过，年轻人们也开始走上台前，我们老一辈也到了放手的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C937E09014CDFBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567204:1":{"text":"세대마다 각자의 선택이 있지. 숲의 흥망성쇠와 같이 말이야.","source_cn":"一代人有一代人的选择，就像丛林的兴衰更替。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF05F3D38E5B3FB2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567205:1":{"text":"탄생과 성장, 노쇠와 죽음... 이러한 순환이야 말로 가장 이로운 생존의 형태란다.","source_cn":"新生、成长、衰老、死亡——这样的轮回，才是最有益于生存的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2A35AA263CAF8C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041567206:1":{"text":"...고목은 수천 년도 살 수 있는데, 권력은 왜 그렇지 않은 걸까요?","source_cn":"……古树可以存在千百年，为何统治就不能如此呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEBE5A66714F8798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041567207:1":{"text":"후후후, 우리는 숲에 살지만 풀과 나무가 아니지 않은가.","source_cn":"呵呵呵，那是因为，我们生活在丛林中，但我们并非草木啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1AE0188771040AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041567208:1":{"text":"우리는 빠르게 성장하고, 나무보다 더 많은 일을 할 수 있지. 그러니 소멸도 더 빨리 찾아오는 법이란다.","source_cn":"我们成长得更快，比树木能做的事情更多，所以我们的消亡也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D47C97AFB80E96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041567209:1":{"text":"한 나라의 왕과 국민이 모두 오랜 세월을 살게 된다면...","source_cn":"如果一个国家，从国王到国民，都有着无比漫长的悠久生命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDAB569C4FCAD7D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041567210:1":{"text":"그 나라의 리듬 역시 느리겠지. 어쩌면 지금까지도 천 년 전과 같은 나날을 보내고 있을 지 모르겠구나.","source_cn":"那么那个国度，想必节奏也是同样的缓慢——或许直至今日还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF55C631E2AE6B40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041567211:1":{"text":"그렇다면 통치자의 삶은 길지만, 백성들은 그렇지 않다면요?","source_cn":"那么，如果统治者生命长久，而国民则恰好相反呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D157F1282AF8BE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041567212:1":{"text":"토양을 잃은 식물은 결국 스스로 시들어 버리는 법이란다.","source_cn":"失去了土壤的植物，最终自己也会衰亡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D2FCC27ABE1BA4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041567213:1":{"text":"그 사실을 이미 알고 있지 않으냐?","source_cn":"我想，你其实是懂得这个道理的，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA76EA85C73DFAEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041567214:1":{"text":"...저는 평범한 무인일 뿐입니다.","source_cn":"……我只是一介武夫。仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C84A438A011B1D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:都铎":{"text":"튜더","source":"都铎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雅顿":{"text":"아든","source":"雅顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}